      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Companies getting real results from AI aren’t only using foundation models (FMs) off the shelf.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-new-ways-to-customize-models-with-sagemaker-ai-without-managing-gpus/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:00:04.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:31.954Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "We launched Amazon SageMaker AI serverless model customization to solve these challenges, and today, we’re expanding it with the general availability launch of training sessions.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-new-ways-to-customize-models-with-sagemaker-ai-without-managing-gpus/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:00:04.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:31.954Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With training sessions you get control over the post-training logic without managing the underlying infrastructure.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-new-ways-to-customize-models-with-sagemaker-ai-without-managing-gpus/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:00:04.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:31.954Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "SageMaker AI handles GPU allocation, distributed execution, fault recovery, and checkpoint storage.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-new-ways-to-customize-models-with-sagemaker-ai-without-managing-gpus/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:00:04.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:31.954Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Customize without the hassles of infrastructure management",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-new-ways-to-customize-models-with-sagemaker-ai-without-managing-gpus/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:00:04.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:31.954Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With SageMaker AI serverless model customization, you don’t choose instance types, manage clusters, or write distributed training configuration.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-new-ways-to-customize-models-with-sagemaker-ai-without-managing-gpus/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:00:04.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:31.954Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "“With SageMaker AI Serverless Training Sessions, we fine-tuned gpt-oss-20b for agentic, multi-turn tool calling against our Amazon Neptune knowledge graph — and the platform handled the infrastructure for us.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-new-ways-to-customize-models-with-sagemaker-ai-without-managing-gpus/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:00:04.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:31.954Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Write your own training loop on SageMaker AI serverless model customization training sessions, available today with support for gpt-oss-20b , gemma-4-31B-it , Qwen3.6-27B , and Qwen3.8-27B .",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-new-ways-to-customize-models-with-sagemaker-ai-without-managing-gpus/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:00:04.000Z",
