      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In your IDE: Install the SageMaker Python SDK (on Linux or macOS with Python 3.10 to 3.12), clone the cookbook, and start developing.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/announcing-new-ways-to-customize-models-with-sagemaker-ai-without-managing-gpus/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
